---
import UxCard from "../UxCard.astro";
---

<UxCard
  id="D-07"
  domain="Data"
  domainClass="d-d"
  title=`Tables for Lookup.<br/>Charts for Patterns.`
  rule=`<strong>Charts reveal patterns; tables reveal values.</strong> If a user needs to look up a specific number, a table serves them better than a chart. If they need to understand a trend, distribution, or comparison across categories, a chart does what a table can't.`
>
<div class="fr-5 d07-visual">
<div class="flex-box-neutral">
<div class="vis-label-muted-sm">Use TABLE when…</div>
<div class="check-list check-list-sm">
<div class="check-item"><span class="check-icon">→</span>Exact values matter</div>
<div class="check-item"><span class="check-icon">→</span>Users scan rows</div>
<div class="check-item"><span class="check-icon">→</span>Multiple attributes per item</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex-box-neutral">
<div class="vis-label-muted-sm">Use CHART when…</div>
<div class="check-list check-list-sm">
<div class="check-item"><span class="check-icon">→</span>Shape / trend matters</div>
<div class="check-item"><span class="check-icon">→</span>Comparing categories</div>
<div class="check-item"><span class="check-icon">→</span>Relative size is the point</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</UxCard>